sequenceDiagram
    %% SD8 - Manage staff, rules and upkeep
    %% Stories: 10, 11, 12, 49, 50, 52, 53, 54
    %% Description: The camp administrator assigns positions, warns camp workers and maintains the rules. Camp workers see the campers in their charge, submit reports, and report missing supplies and repairs.
    actor AD as Camp administrator
    actor WP as Camp worker (person)
    participant CM as Camp
    participant CW as CampWorker
    participant PO as Position
    participant RU as Rule
    participant AC as Activity
    participant SU as Supply
    participant RP as Repair

    %% covers 10
    AD->>CM: assign positions to staff
    CM->>CW: camp workers
    CW->>PO: position
    %% covers 11
    AD->>CW: warn camp worker
    %% covers 12
    AD->>CM: create or modify rules
    CM->>RU: rules
    %% covers 49, 54
    WP->>CW: see campers in charge and where
    CW->>PO: position
    PO->>AC: activities in charge
    %% covers 50
    WP->>CW: submit completion report
    %% covers 52
    WP->>SU: report missing supplies
    SU->>CM: camp short of supplies
    %% covers 53
    WP->>RP: report necessary repairs
